WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:31.791
At the beginning of Chapter 12,

2
00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:33.166
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.875
the difference between devotion
to the formless and the personal form.

4
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.500
He also explained

5
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.000
how the path of devotion

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.958
to the personal form is sweeter and simpler.

7
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:46.250
He then described the levels of this devotion,

8
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:46.916
and after that,

9
00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:50.208
He described all the qualities of an ideal devotee

10
00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:51.916
that make them most

11
00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:53.875
dear to Lord Krishna.

12
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:57.250
Now, concluding Chapter 12,

13
00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.166
Lord Krishna

14
00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:59.750
reveals the essence of Bhakti Yoga

15
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.916
in this twentieth verse,

16
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:05.375
and says that devotees who
walk this path of devotion

17
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:07.166
with deep faith

18
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.333
and complete surrender,

19
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:12.416
those devotees are most dear to Him.

20
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.708
This verse once again

21
00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:16.541
establishes that Bhakti Yoga

22
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:18.291
is not only special,

23
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:19.375
but compared

24
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:23.041
to other paths of spiritual progress,
Bhakti Yoga is

25
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.750
also the supreme.

26
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:30.875
In this chapter,

27
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:33.208
Lord Krishna has established Bhakti Yoga

28
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:34.541
as the supreme path

29
00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:37.375
of spiritual upliftment.

30
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:39.500
Bhakti Yoga is a path

31
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.416
that is superior to formless practice,

32
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:45.833
renunciation, and sannyasa, all of these.

33
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.791
Here He assures

34
00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:48.458
that those who

35
00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:50.583
adopt this path of devotion with faith

36
00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:52.791
and trust,

37
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:56.125
they are most dear to Him.

38
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:58.875
Here the word dharmamritam means

39
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:01.500
the nectar of dharma, that is, devotion.

40
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.958
It is that nectar of dharma, that essence which,

41
00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.375
freeing us from the cycle of birth and death,

42
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:10.791
is capable of giving us the highest joy.

43
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:12.500
Karma, knowledge,

44
00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.666
or austerity also give us

45
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.583
the fruit of spiritual upliftment,

46
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:18.750
but this fruit is not eternal.

47
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:22.000
Whereas devotion done with
complete surrender

48
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.208
gives us eternal joy and liberation,

49
00:02:25.208 --> 00:02:26.583
but also, connects us in an unbreakable

50
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:30.666
bond with Lord Krishna.

51
00:02:30.666 --> 00:02:34.708
Paryupasate means complete
surrender with mind, heart,

52
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:39.000
and body, that is, supreme devotion.

53
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.333
It is not the name of occasionally singing bhajan,

54
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:45.208
but the feeling of dedicating every
moment of life,

55
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.250
every action,

56
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.750
to Lord Krishna.

57
00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.250
Here faith carries great importance.

58
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.333
The devotee in whose mind

59
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.791
there is complete trust

60
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:57.625
that Lord Krishna will take care of everything,

61
00:02:57.625 --> 00:03:00.750
only they can surrender with a peaceful mind.

62
00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:04.541
Whereas without complete faith,
the devotee will be overtaken

63
00:03:04.541 --> 00:03:07.208
by some doubt at some point.

64
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.416
Mat-paramah,

65
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.375
meaning those who make Me the supreme

66
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.875
goal of their life.

67
00:03:11.875 --> 00:03:13.500
This word shows

68
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.791
that devotion is not just one chapter of life,

69
00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:19.708
but is the very supreme purpose of life.

70
00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:22.250
And one who has tasted the
sweetness of this devotion

71
00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.333
then no longer chases

72
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:26.458
knowledge, strength, and liberation,

73
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:29.666
because for a true devotee,

74
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:31.166
only Lord Krishna's love

75
00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:34.375
and His service is the sole goal.

76
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:37.708
And when Lord Krishna says most dear,

77
00:03:37.708 --> 00:03:39.833
He is expressing the feeling

78
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:42.458
that such a devotee is not merely dear, but

79
00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:46.041
is the most dear of all to Him.

80
00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:47.958
Many spiritual teachers

81
00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:51.166
have even made clear that
a devotee who is right now

82
00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:54.875
only walking on the path of devotion sincerely,

83
00:03:54.875 --> 00:03:57.416
who has not yet completed their journey,

84
00:03:57.416 --> 00:03:59.958
even that devotee is superior to those

85
00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:01.208
who have attained perfection

86
00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:04.791
on other spiritual paths.

87
00:04:04.791 --> 00:04:06.291
Thus Lord Krishna

88
00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:09.500
makes clear that austerity, knowledge,

89
00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.208
renunciation, charity, dharma, and so on,

90
00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:15.000
above all of these is true devotion alone

91
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.291
that makes someone most dear to Him.

92
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:21.083
And the one who has embraced
this simple, beautiful,

93
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:25.208
and sweet path of devotion, with faith

94
00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:29.791
He then resides in Lord Krishna's own heart.

95
00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:36.208
In this chapter,

96
00:04:36.208 --> 00:04:40.166
I have spoken of many such qualities

97
00:04:40.166 --> 00:04:44.666
that make a person both noble,

98
00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:47.250
and dear to Me.

99
00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.166
Such as

100
00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:50.625
remaining unaffected

101
00:04:50.625 --> 00:04:53.583
by criticism, being free

102
00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:55.875
from envy toward others,

103
00:04:55.875 --> 00:05:00.083
acting without expectation of fruit,

104
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:03.166
and many more such qualities.

105
00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:05.916
And I know

106
00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:11.000
that this doubt will surely have
arisen in your mind,

107
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.875
how can I attain so many qualities

108
00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:17.833
all at once.

109
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:22.250
It seems almost impossible.

110
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.166
Know its simple secret for this.

111
00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:29.125
You do not need to work separately

112
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:33.083
on each of these qualities.

113
00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:36.583
Let us understand it with an example.

114
00:05:36.583 --> 00:05:41.208
For good health, you do not attend separately

115
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:43.708
to each part of the body,

116
00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:48.125
instead you adopt a healthy lifestyle,

117
00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:50.458
eat the right food,

118
00:05:50.458 --> 00:05:54.125
exercise, and every part

119
00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:57.541
of the body balances itself.

120
00:05:57.541 --> 00:05:58.916
Now

121
00:05:58.916 --> 00:06:01.791
take a physician.

122
00:06:01.791 --> 00:06:06.625
They give you medicine for immediate relief,

123
00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:10.375
but for full recovery of health,

124
00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:13.333
they also advise living a regular life,

125
00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:17.708
and eating nourishing food.

126
00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:22.250
So if you adopt a healthy lifestyle,

127
00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.208
every part of the body

128
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:27.375
will become healthy on its own.

129
00:06:27.375 --> 00:06:29.375
In the same way,

130
00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:32.916
devotion is that lifestyle,

131
00:06:32.916 --> 00:06:35.625
that nourishing food,

132
00:06:35.625 --> 00:06:39.583
by adopting which in life, all qualities

133
00:06:39.583 --> 00:06:43.583
begin to emerge in you on their own.

134
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:45.458
Think about it.

135
00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:51.708
If you keep Me in your heart every moment,

136
00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:54.083
then while criticising someone,

137
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:57.750
or while doing something wrong, on your own

138
00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.916
you will become aware.

139
00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:03.083
On your own, the things I have taught

140
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:06.666
will begin to blend into your life.

141
00:07:06.666 --> 00:07:09.291
And in this way, goodness

142
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:10.375
and qualities

143
00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:15.500
will begin to arise within you on their own.

144
00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.791
Do not consider yourself bad
and blame yourself,

145
00:07:19.791 --> 00:07:21.958
nor struggle.

146
00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:24.083
Simply

147
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:26.916
fix your mind in devotion,

148
00:07:26.916 --> 00:07:30.125
and then watch, the change

149
00:07:30.125 --> 00:07:32.708
will begin to happen on its own.

150
00:07:37.208 --> 00:07:41.250
You are reading the Bhagavad Gita.

151
00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.291
This makes clear

152
00:07:43.291 --> 00:07:47.041
that you wish for spiritual progress.

153
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:50.333
And naturally, you will want

154
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:55.083
your children to also become good citizens,

155
00:07:55.083 --> 00:07:58.083
to also develop good qualities,

156
00:07:58.083 --> 00:08:03.125
for the flame of spirituality to
awaken in them too.

157
00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:05.791
Now think for a moment

158
00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:08.083
about how children learn.

159
00:08:08.083 --> 00:08:12.083
They do not learn as much from
hearing your words,

160
00:08:12.083 --> 00:08:14.541
as they learn from watching your behaviour

161
00:08:14.541 --> 00:08:18.750
and conduct.

162
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:21.958
However much you explain
to them about patience,

163
00:08:21.958 --> 00:08:26.333
compassion, and faith,

164
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:27.791
but

165
00:08:27.791 --> 00:08:32.125
if they see irritability in you itself,

166
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:36.958
hear you speak rude words to others,

167
00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:41.750
if they see a selfish person in you,

168
00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:46.583
then no matter how much you explain, will they

169
00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:51.208
absorb spirituality and its qualities?

170
00:08:51.208 --> 00:08:54.083
Will they be able to learn?

171
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:55.333
No.

172
00:08:55.333 --> 00:08:58.791
Teach spirituality and its qualities

173
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:02.250
not through words and sermons,

174
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.583
but through your own conduct and behaviour.

175
00:09:06.583 --> 00:09:10.208
If you want your family

176
00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:14.541
to understand the importance of
devotion, then first

177
00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:17.541
you must show complete trust

178
00:09:17.541 --> 00:09:20.375
and surrender.

179
00:09:20.375 --> 00:09:24.208
When they see that even in difficult times

180
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:26.541
you remain calm,

181
00:09:26.541 --> 00:09:30.875
and treat them with gentleness,

182
00:09:30.875 --> 00:09:35.666
that without criticising other
people or circumstances,

183
00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:39.375
you know how to remain content,

184
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:44.125
then all of this will inspire them too.

185
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:45.708
And this very inspiration

186
00:09:45.708 --> 00:09:49.791
will draw them toward devotion too.

187
00:09:49.791 --> 00:09:51.708
The influence of words

188
00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:54.916
lasts only for a few moments,

189
00:09:54.916 --> 00:09:58.375
but the conduct of the elders at home

190
00:09:58.375 --> 00:10:02.458
gives inspiration for a lifetime.

191
00:10:02.458 --> 00:10:05.416
If you want to bring your family

192
00:10:05.416 --> 00:10:09.500
toward spirituality,

193
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.291
then not just

194
00:10:11.291 --> 00:10:13.208
by saying it,

195
00:10:13.208 --> 00:10:17.125
show them by living a spiritual life.

196
00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:22.333
Your own transformation too will become

197
00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:25.833
the most powerful cause of
their spiritual inspiration.

198
00:10:30.333 --> 00:10:34.958
You too will certainly know someone

199
00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:38.458
whose goals keep changing.

200
00:10:38.458 --> 00:10:42.208
Who looks at every decision with doubt,

201
00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:44.958
who wavers quickly.

202
00:10:44.958 --> 00:10:47.875
Such instability keeps many people

203
00:10:47.875 --> 00:10:51.083
away from success.

204
00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:53.833
They move forward having made a decision,

205
00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:56.291
but as soon as a difficulty comes,

206
00:10:56.291 --> 00:10:59.583
they get frightened and change course.

207
00:10:59.583 --> 00:11:02.333
Until there is complete sincerity

208
00:11:02.333 --> 00:11:05.000
and surrender,

209
00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.666
success is not possible.

210
00:11:08.666 --> 00:11:11.750
Whatever the goal may be,

211
00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.166
whether a new job,

212
00:11:14.166 --> 00:11:16.583
a new project, or

213
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:20.625
a great professional responsibility,

214
00:11:20.625 --> 00:11:23.916
whenever you become

215
00:11:23.916 --> 00:11:26.791
completely devoted to your goal,

216
00:11:26.791 --> 00:11:27.583
then

217
00:11:27.583 --> 00:11:29.333
the difficulties of that path

218
00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:32.208
do not affect you.

219
00:11:32.208 --> 00:11:35.750
Instead of being frightened by difficulties,

220
00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.791
you find solutions

221
00:11:37.791 --> 00:11:41.083
and keep moving forward with firmness.

222
00:11:41.083 --> 00:11:43.583
Success itself

223
00:11:43.583 --> 00:11:46.791
begins to be drawn toward you.

224
00:11:46.791 --> 00:11:50.500
It is not necessary that the most intelligent

225
00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.458
or talented person

226
00:11:52.458 --> 00:11:54.916
reaches the pinnacle of success.

227
00:11:54.916 --> 00:11:57.250
But yes,

228
00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.166
the one in whom unwavering trust

229
00:12:00.166 --> 00:12:03.000
and surrender has awakened,

230
00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.625
then no one can stop them from succeeding.

231
00:12:07.625 --> 00:12:12.208
If you wish to take something from this verse,

232
00:12:12.208 --> 00:12:16.583
then take these two words.

233
00:12:16.583 --> 00:12:20.000
Shraddha and

234
00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.458
paryupasate,

235
00:12:22.458 --> 00:12:25.125
meaning faith

236
00:12:25.125 --> 00:12:29.791
and complete surrender.

237
00:12:29.791 --> 00:12:31.166
Then watch,

238
00:12:31.166 --> 00:12:34.375
no difficulty will frighten you,

239
00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:39.875
no problem will be able to stop you, because

240
00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:43.416
the one who has faith and surrender,

241
00:12:43.416 --> 00:12:47.666
success itself remains eager to reach them.

242
00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:53.000
Nature itself stands by that person.

243
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.291
Keep this in mind.
